---
import SiteFrame from "../components/SiteFrame.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import { GITHUB_URL, WEB_START_URL } from "../site";
---
<SiteFrame title="About Kith" description="A personal AI assistant that remembers context and helps with the work around your day.">
  <h1>A little help with the work around your day</h1>
  <p>Kith is your personal AI assistant. Start a conversation, share what matters, and return to the same assistant when you need help again.</p>
  <h2>Built around real tasks</h2>
  <p>Prepare for a meeting. Find the email you meant to reply to. Compare a few options before making a decision. Kith can work with the information you share and the accounts you choose to connect.</p>
  <h2>Context that carries forward</h2>
  <p>Your preferences and saved memories help Kith understand the next task. Review them, change them, or ask Kith to forget. Add a focused bot when you want a separate helper for a recurring job.</p>
  <h2>Room for your judgment</h2>
  <p>Follow sources, review results, and respond to requests for approval. Kith can make mistakes, so check important details before acting on them.</p>
  <h2>Open about how it works</h2>
  <p>Kith’s source code is available on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a> under Apache-2.0. For everyday use, start in the app. For account or product questions, visit <a href="/support/">Support</a>.</p>
  <div class="alt-actions"><Button href={WEB_START_URL}>Get started</Button></div>
</SiteFrame>
